TEXT -1128 1464 Right 2 !* Application: two-switch PWM converters, CCM or DCM with (possibly) transformer\n* Limitations: ideal switches, no transformer\n****************************************************************************************\n* Parameters:\n* L=equivalent inductance (relevant for DCM), referred to primary\n* fs=switching frequency\n* n=transformer turns ratio 1:n (primary:secondary)\n****************************************************************************************\n* Nodes: (same as in ccm1)\n****************************************************************************************\n.subckt ccm-dcm2 1 2 3 4 5\n.param L = {Lm}\n.param Fsw = {Fs}\n.param n={Ns_div_Np}\nEt 1 2 value={(1-v(u))*v(3,4)/v(u)/{n}}\nGd 4 3 value={(1-v(u))*i(Et)/v(u)/{n}}\nGa 0 a value={MAX(i(Et),0)}\nVa a b 0\nRdummy b 0 10\nEu u 0 table {MAX(v(5), v(5)*v(5)/(v(5)*v(5)+2*{L}*{n}*{Fsw}*i(Va)/v(3,4)))} (0 0) (1 1)\n.ends\n***************************************************************************************
